note The release. A drop that is no drag, onto the grabbed step itself, or outside every row does nothing. Under hangs the step as the row's last child; before places it ahead of the row among the row's siblings; after places it ahead of the row's next sibling in list order, or at the end. Map::place refuses a step under its own subtree, which the status words. Slots change with the list order, so steps_moved remaps them by id before the status names the new number.

